## Customization
Edit the `SKILLS` list in `analyzer.py` to add terms relevant to your target jobs. Keep related terms distinct when necessary to reduce false matches.

## Troubleshooting
- `pip` not recognized: install Python from python.org and enable “Add Python to PATH”.
- `No module named flask`: activate your virtual environment and run `pip install -r requirements.txt`.
- PDF has no extracted text: it may be scanned. Try a text-based PDF or paste the resume text.
- Port 5000 is busy: change `app.run(debug=True, port=5001)` and visit port 5001.
- For public deployment, disable debug mode, set a secure secret key, add CSRF protection, and configure production hosting.
